                GasPriceSettingsSource P1/S8 seam + injected GasPriceFormatting; no HTTP in the view.
  composition : fuel-pump IconBox + title 'Gas Price Auto-Poll' + subtitle; Auto-Poll toggle (Play/Pause + Running/
                Stopped, success tint) inside a labelled field w/ HelpIcon; Poll Interval menu select (Daily/Weekly/
                Bi-weekly/Monthly) w/ HelpIcon; Current Price + Last Polled cells; 'Poll Now' primary button (bolt,
                pending spinner) + EIA source caption.
  states      : loading / empty / error(+retry) / data + connection axis (live/stale/offline chip+banner, one-shot
